MongoDB
-------

ForestWatch uses the Motor/PyMongo drivers to talk to a MongoDB server that
the licensee operates. MongoDB Server is a separate product with its own
license (SSPL for current MongoDB Inc. builds, or another distribution the
licensee chooses). This package does not grant a MongoDB Server license.


