Data sources and provider terms
-------------------------------

In-code labels (not a substitute for the provider's current legal text):

  Copernicus Land Monitoring Service / CORINE
    backend/app/data/gis/romania_corine_simplified.geojson
    backend/app/services/clms_context_provider.py
    Label: "Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Terms"
    The bundled GeoJSON is a simplified Romania reference derived from CLC
    2018-class metadata. It is not an official full-resolution CLC export.
    VERIFY BEFORE DISTRIBUTION: Copernicus licence typically requires
    attribution for commercial use of Copernicus products and derivatives.

  NASA FIRMS
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/firms.py
    Label: "NASA FIRMS open data policy"
    Live use requires the licensee's FIRMS_API_KEY. Empty key uses a bundled
    mock dataset for development.

  Global Forest Watch
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/gfw_integrated_alerts_constants.py
    Label: "Global Forest Watch data policy — attribution required"
    Live use is opt-in (ENABLE_FOREST_DISTURBANCE) and requires GFW_API_KEY.

  EEA Air Quality
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/eea_air_quality.py
    Label: "EEA standard data policy — free and open for public use"
    Opt-in (ENABLE_EEA_AIR_QUALITY). Token optional depending on EEA access.

  Copernicus EMS Rapid Mapping
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/cems_rapid_mapping.py
    Label: "Copernicus data policy — free and open; attribution EMS/EU"
    Opt-in (ENABLE_CEMS_RAPID_MAPPING).

  EFFIS
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/effis_constants.py
    Label: "Copernicus/EFFIS EU data policy — free and open; attribution required"
    Opt-in (ENABLE_EFFIS_WILDFIRE_CONTEXT / ENABLE_EFFIS_LIVE).

  Open-Meteo
    backend/app/services/source_intelligence_service.py
    Label: "Open-Meteo free API — https://open-meteo.com"
    No API key in this package. Attribution still required by provider terms.

  Stripe
    The stripe Python SDK is a dependency. Stripe accounts, API keys, and
    Customer data belong to the licensee. Billing is disabled by default
    (ENABLE_BILLING=false) and has not been validated against a live Stripe
    account as part of this package.


